<title>USA: Stratus names Maurice Castonguay CFO.</title>
<headline>Stratus names Maurice Castonguay CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stratus Computer Inc said Monday it named Maurice &quot;Moe&quot; Castonguay chief financial officer, treasurer, and vice president of finance and administration.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said Castonguay replaces Robert Donahue, who left Stratus last week for a position with another company.</p>
<p>The company said Castonguay was previously CFO at Gradient Technologies Inc, a provider of security for the Internet/Intranet markets.</p>
